    "body": "Because `nodes[1]` time was not mocked in test_block_inv, it was possible for wall clock to advance 2s by the time `nodes[0]` had delivered a tx announcement to it. Then, `nodes[1]` would request the tx from a test peer, never receive the tx, and fail in sync_mempools().\n",
