      ],
      "message": "test: fix intermittent failure in p2p_tx_download.py\n\nBecause nodes[1] time was not mocked in test_block_inv, it was\npossible for wall clock to advance 2s by the time nodes[0] had\ndelivered a tx announcement to it. Then, nodes[1] would request\nthe tx from a test peer, never receive the tx, and fail in\nsync_mempools().",
